OL,3,GNEWSARailway station set for #200m
OL,4,Afunding boost
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeeds railway station is to receive an
OL,7,Fextra #200m for major improvements
OL,8,Faimed at reducing overcrowding,
OL,9,Fimproving journeys and laying the
OL,10,Ffoundations for broader public
OL,11,Ftransport plans for Yorkshire.
OL,13,FThe additional funding, announced
OL,14,Falongside Chancellor John Healey's
OL,15,Ffirst Budget, brings the overall
OL,16,Finvestment in the station to more than
OL,17,F#300m, with upgrades due to be
OL,18,Fcompleted by 2030.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,382,380,200,160,0,100
